_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"rich_text\"><div style=\"line-height:175%; font-size:13px; text-align:left; direction:ltr; display:inline-block; vertical-align:top; width:100%\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> </span>\n<div style=\"font-family:Arial; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; line-height:1.5; text-align:justify\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #3e464b; font-weight: bold;\"> </span>\n<p style=\"color:#3e464b; line-height:150%; text-align:center; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">You still have time to sign up to our free trial</span></p>\n<p style=\"color:#3e464b; line-height:150%; font-weight:normal; text-align:center\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"color:#3e464b; line-height:150%; text-align:center; font-weight:normal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">To mark the 1st&nbsp;anniversary of Green Street’s commercial real estate solutions in Canada, we offered&nbsp;free trial access to our news until Friday 18 July.</span></p>\n<p style=\"color:#3e464b; line-height:150%; font-weight:normal; text-align:center\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"color:#3e464b; line-height:150%; font-weight:normal; text-align:center\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">You can still take advantage of this opportunity: Sign up and enjoy 2 weeks of complimentary access to Canada News.</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"color:#3e464b; line-height:150%; font-weight:normal; text-align:center\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"color:#3e464b; line-height:150%; font-weight:normal; text-align:center\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Discover reporting across all key property sectors and asset classes in Canada, with real-time CRE insights that enable you to act first and stay ahead.</span></p>\n<p style=\"color:#3e464b; line-height:150%; font-weight:normal; text-align:center\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%; font-weight:normal; text-align:center\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">To gain access to the trial, simply visit <span style=\"color: #559b43;\"><a href=\"https://greenstreetnews.com/canada\" style=\"color:#559b43; font-weight:bold\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hs-link-id=\"0\" data-hs-link-id-v2=\"bjKC64BK\" target=\"_blank\">Green Street News Canada</a></span>, select an article and verify your details via a short form. If you have any questions or cannot log in, <span style=\"color: #559b43;\"><a href=\"mailto:lbellwood@greenstreet.com\" style=\"font-weight:bold; color:#559b43\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hs-link-id=\"0\" data-hs-link-id-v2=\"9GwkF+Sj\" target=\"_blank\">contact us</a></span> and we'll get back to you as soon as possible.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"hs_padded\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; padding:25px\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_15949568556487\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"border-collapse:separate!important\">\n    <tbody><tr>\n      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" bgcolor=\"#559b43\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; border-radius:8px; cursor:auto; background-color:#559b43; mso-padding-alt:12px 24px\">\n        <a href=\"https://greenstreetnews.com/article/kingsett-in-talks-to-buy-downtown-vancouver-offices-for-u